    <item>
      <title>०१</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/01/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/01/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;अग्न᳓ये&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; न᳓मो गायत्र्यै᳓ न᳓मस्त्रिवृ᳓ते न᳓मो रथन्थरा᳓य न᳓मो वसन्ता᳓य न᳓मः प्रा᳓च्यै दिशे᳓ न᳓मः प्राणा᳓य न᳓मो व᳓सुभ्यो न᳓मः॥१॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;footnotes&#34; role=&#34;doc-endnotes&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li id=&#34;fn:1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Kâth. 5, 11, 1-6 auch in T1 vorhanden und darnach accentuirt. (Kâth. 5, 11, 1-6 also present in T1 and accented after it.)&amp;#160;&lt;a href=&#34;#fnref:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-backref&#34; role=&#34;doc-backlink&#34;&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>०२</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/02/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/02/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;इ᳓न्द्राय न᳓मस्त्रिष्टु᳓भे न᳓मः पञ्चदशा᳓य न᳓मो बृहते᳓ न᳓मो ग्रीष्मा᳓य न᳓मो दक्षिणा᳓यै दिशे᳓ न᳓मो व्याना᳓य न᳓मो रुद्रे᳓भ्यो न᳓मः॥२॥&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>०३</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/03/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/03/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;मरु᳓द्भ्यो न᳓मो ज᳓गत्यै न᳓मस्सप्तदशा᳓य न᳓मो वैरूपा᳓य न᳓मो वर्षा᳓भ्यो न᳓मः प्रती᳓च्यै दिशे᳓ न᳓मोऽपाना᳓य न᳓म आदित्ये᳓भ्यो न᳓मः॥३॥&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>०४</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/04/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/04/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;वि᳓श्वेभ्यो देवे᳓भ्यो न᳓मोऽनुष्टु᳓भे न᳓म एकविँशा᳓य न᳓मो वैराजा᳓य न᳓मश्शर᳓दे न᳓म उ᳓दीच्यै दिशे᳓ न᳓मस्समाना᳓य न᳓मश्चन्द्र᳓मसे न᳓मः॥४॥&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>०५</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/05/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/05/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;मित्रा᳓व᳓रुणाभ्यां न᳓मः&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; पङ्क्त्यै᳓ न᳓मस्त्रिणवत्रयस्त्रिँशा᳓भ्यो न᳓मश्शाक्वररैवता᳓भ्यां&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:2&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:2&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; न᳓मो हेमन्तशिशिरा᳓भ्यां न᳓म ऊर्ध्वा᳓यै दिशे᳓ न᳓म उदाना᳓य न᳓मो वि᳓ष्णवे न᳓मः॥५॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;footnotes&#34; role=&#34;doc-endnotes&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li id=&#34;fn:1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hier folgt in Ch शाक्वररैवताभ्यां नमो, ein offenbarer Fehler, der in T1 sich nicht findet, wo diese Worte nur ein Mal und zwar an der richtigen Stelle stehen. (Here follows in Ch शाक्वररैवताभ्यां नमो, an obvious error that is not found in T1, where these words stand only once and indeed in the right place.)&amp;#160;&lt;a href=&#34;#fnref:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-backref&#34; role=&#34;doc-backlink&#34;&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>०६</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/06/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/11_namaskAravachanam/06/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;पृथिव्यै᳓ न᳓मोऽग्न᳓ये न᳓मो भूता᳓य न᳓मश्च᳓क्षुषे न᳓मोऽन्त᳓रिक्षाय न᳓मो वाय᳓वे न᳓मो भ᳓व्याय न᳓मश्श्रो᳓त्राय न᳓मो दिवे᳓ न᳓मस्सू᳓र्याय न᳓मो भविष्यते᳓ न᳓मो म᳓नसे न᳓मः॥६॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;इति नमस्कारवचनमेकादशम्॥&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;footnotes&#34; role=&#34;doc-endnotes&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li id=&#34;fn:1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So die Unterschrift des Capitels in Ch. (Thus the colophon of the chapter in Ch)&amp;#160;&lt;a href=&#34;#fnref:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-backref&#34; role=&#34;doc-backlink&#34;&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
